.claude/launch.json

# A local production REHEARSAL: XAMPP Apache + MariaDB serving the Bronze layout
# (docroot assembly, rendered .htaccess, static export) against an isolated copy of
# api/ with its own .env. Created by scripts/local-production/up.sh.
#
# Ignored because it is a build output containing a generated APP_KEY, a database
# password and a CRON_TOKEN. Nothing in it is evidence about the Ethio Telecom host —
# it is my Apache, my MariaDB and my grants. Delete the directory to undo.
.local-production/
